{title: Sadka Kiya Yun Ishq Ka}
{artist: Mahalakshmi Iyer Vishal Shekhar I Hate Luv Storys}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Kuch khwab dekhe hai,        Kuch [Am]rang soche hain
Ab [Cm]maine kal apne,        tere [G]sang soche hain
Iss [G]raah mein jab bhi,        tu [Am]saath hoti hai
Kisson ke [Cm]panno si,        har [G]baat hoti hai
[G]Rooh jo huyi meri fida,        [G]toh pal mein uthi koyi sada
Ke dil se [Am]hua judaa judaa,        toota main [G]iss tara
Sadka [C]kiya yun ishq [Am]ka,        ke sar [Cm]jhuka jaha, [G]deedar huya
Sadka [C]kiya yun ishq [Am]ka,        ke sar [Cm]jhuka jaha, [G]deedar huya
[Em]Tere mudne se suraj udh gaya,        [C]Teri roshni ke saaye mein main
[Cm]dhoop si [G]khili,        [Em]Mera aasman bhi chota padh gaya
[C]Mujhe jab se hai baahon mein,        [Cm]teri panah [D]mili
[D]Woh thehri teri adaa adaa,        ke ruk bhi [Bm]gaya mera khuda
Toh mujhpe [C]yeh asar huya,        toota main [G]iss tarah
Sadka [C]kiya yun ishq [Am]ka,        ke sar [Cm]jhuka jaha, [G]deedar huya
Sadka [C]kiya yun ishq [Am]ka,        ke sar [Cm]jhuka jaha, [G]deedar huya
[Em]Teri khushbu mein bheege khat mile,        [C]Tere rang ke syaahi se
[Cm]likhe, padhe, [G]sune,        [Em]Teri baaton ke woh saare silsile
[C]Mere dil ki kahani si,        [Cm]sune, kahe, [D]bune
[D]Main kar na sakun bayaan bayaan,        Ke chup si [Bm]hui meri zubaan
Yeh dil [C]mehman hua hua,        Toota main [G]is tarah
Sadka [C]kiya yun ishq [Am]ka,        ke sar [Cm]jhuka jaha, [G]deedar huya
